'''Madhead''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Madhead
|image = E 687.png
|first appearance = [[Tower of Saviors Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 300¢ - 1,185¢
}}

==Enemy==
Madhead is an enemy who has a 100% chance to weaken all cat Units, with [[Omnistrike]]. He is not a challenge to deal with alone, but can become a nuisance when in pairs or groups, especially in high magnifications. His solid movement speed and threat of using any meatshield as a stepping stone causes him to be formidable in even groups of three.

==Strategy==
Powerful long ranged attackers like Housewife Cat, or high powered attackers like Awakened Bahamut Cat can quickly dispose of this enemy, but in higher magnifications, your Cat Units can have a harder time trying to deal with this annoying enemy unless they  are high level enough to deal with this enemy.

